OL,3,GNEWSAContractors remove island that
OL,4,Ablocked bus route
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork has started to remove a newly
OL,7,Finstalled traffic island after it left
OL,8,Fa road in a village in Leicestershire
OL,9,Ftoo narrow for buses to access.
OL,11,FArriva Midlands said it had withdrawn
OL,12,Fits services from the centre of
OL,13,FQueniborough as drivers were unable to
OL,14,Ftravel along Rearsby Road without
OL,15,Fmounting the kerb.
OL,17,FContractors working for developer David
OL,18,FWilson Homes returned on Monday to
OL,19,Fstart taking out the pedestrian refuge,
OL,20,Fwhich they recently built as part of
OL,21,Fwork to increase the capacity of a
OL,22,Fnearby crossroads.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
